sections.bodyMarkdown:
Define an aggregate type:

    struct Config {
        int maxOrders;
        double tickSize;
        bool enableLogging;
    };

Initialize members by name:

    Config config{
        .maxOrders = 1000,
        .tickSize = 0.01,
        .enableLogging = true
    };

You can also initialize only some members:

    Config config{
        .maxOrders = 1000,
        .tickSize = 0.01
    };

The remaining members are value-initialized.

* * *

